hat slowing down when you  pass any kind of emergency vehicle or  tow truck  slow down to at least 20 miles an hour  even if you're in a high speed area like  an  interstate now as for the woman who  police say  hit billet coletta spain she is due back  in court  this tuesday april 13. reporting live in  henderson tonight sasha loftis  8 news now
 

